aurorae: Aurorae is a theme engine for KWin window decorations, i.e. the frames
aurorae: around windows that typically contain the window title and buttons for
aurorae: closing, minimizing, etc. the window. Aurorae uses either SVG or QML
aurorae: to render the decoration and buttons, and there is a simple config
aurorae: file for configuring the theme details.
